1
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:20,850
[Sung Inho]

2
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,460
[Kim Domin]

3
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:50,050
[Summertime]

4
00:00:53,830 --> 00:00:54,980
Listen up.

5
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:58,270
Our class is scheduled to
take photos at 2:30.

6
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:00,540
So don't go too far.

7
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:02,380
Gather here by 2:30. Got it?

8
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,620
-Yes.
-Yes.

9
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:05,069
I can't hear you! Got it?

10
00:01:05,170 --> 00:01:06,280
-Yes!
-Yes!

11
00:01:06,410 --> 00:01:07,810
Don't cause any trouble.

12
00:01:08,050 --> 00:01:08,860
-Yes.
-Yes.

13
00:01:09,010 --> 00:01:09,789
Dismissed.

14
00:01:11,650 --> 00:01:14,120
Hey, Kwon Yihyun. Hang out with me.

15
00:01:15,270 --> 00:01:15,770
No.

16
00:01:15,930 --> 00:01:16,610
Why?

17
00:01:16,870 --> 00:01:19,130
It's wrong to bully your friends, Eunho.

18
00:01:19,940 --> 00:01:22,539
Did you say something to Yihyun
behind my back?

19
00:01:22,590 --> 00:01:24,850
He's just perceptive.

20
00:01:25,450 --> 00:01:26,360
Let's go.

21
00:01:26,490 --> 00:01:27,680
Go where?

22
00:01:28,220 --> 00:01:29,060
Anywhere.

23
00:01:29,250 --> 00:01:30,740
Let go. You're heavy.

24
00:01:31,510 --> 00:01:32,380
Bear with it.

25
00:01:32,570 --> 00:01:34,470
Are you trying to make me an outcast?

26
00:01:34,470 --> 00:01:35,850
I told you

27
00:01:35,990 --> 00:01:37,420
you're the only one I have.

28
00:01:37,420 --> 00:01:38,910
But you're not the only one I have.

29
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:40,070
No,

30
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:42,070
I must be the only one you have too.

31
00:01:42,070 --> 00:01:43,450
I said no!

32
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:20,050
Yeah.

33
00:02:20,590 --> 00:02:22,240
You're the only one

34
00:02:23,410 --> 00:02:24,540
I have.

35
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:04,940
Yeo Eunho.

36
00:03:06,590 --> 00:03:07,540
Damn it.

37
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:15,050
You think this is funny?

38
00:03:24,130 --> 00:03:27,690
Let's go, or we'll be late.

39
00:03:37,290 --> 00:03:38,420
Cha Dohyun!

40
00:04:48,650 --> 00:04:51,100
Hey, button up your shirt properly!

41
00:04:53,110 --> 00:04:55,580
What happened to you two?

42
00:04:59,290 --> 00:05:01,150
-I'm sorry, sir.
-I'm sorry, sir.

43
00:05:03,930 --> 00:05:06,100
Whatever. Do as you please.

44
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:08,730
Jerk. It's all your fault.

45
00:05:08,950 --> 00:05:11,410
I'll have to take my photo
looking like this.

46
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,370
Yeo Eunho,

47
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:13,600
it's your turn.

48
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,890
Wait a second.

49
00:05:18,620 --> 00:05:21,280
You should look neat
for your graduation photo.

50
00:05:21,380 --> 00:05:22,500
Wear mine.

51
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,480
I have hands too.

52
00:05:33,420 --> 00:05:34,770
It's faster if I do it.

53
00:06:17,930 --> 00:06:19,010
Done.

54
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:25,850
Kid!

55
00:06:27,310 --> 00:06:28,650
Look here.

56
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:32,560
Okay, ready. One!

57
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,370
A bigger smile, please!

58
00:06:35,570 --> 00:06:37,960
Okay, let's go again.

59
00:06:38,030 --> 00:06:41,370
One, two, smile!

60
00:06:43,870 --> 00:06:47,250
[Cha Dohyun]

61
00:08:24,490 --> 00:08:27,090
Yeo Eunho, wake up.

62
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:37,320
What? Is it over?

63
00:08:41,110 --> 00:08:42,350
Did you fall asleep?

64
00:08:44,660 --> 00:08:46,360
Are you blind? Of course I did.

65
00:08:46,940 --> 00:08:48,450
Go back to your classroom.

66
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:56,430
I'm leaving.

67
00:09:07,930 --> 00:09:09,130
What is it?

68
00:09:10,230 --> 00:09:10,930
Yeo Eunho.

69
00:09:11,090 --> 00:09:11,890
What?

70
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:13,590
Wanna come home with me?

71
00:09:16,930 --> 00:09:19,950
Hey, don't say things like that
to other people.

72
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,200
You'll get sued for sexual harassment.

73
00:09:23,060 --> 00:09:24,260
Sexual harassment?

74
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:26,490
People will get the wrong idea.

75
00:09:28,380 --> 00:09:30,070
Did you get the wrong idea too?

76
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:46,410
Stop following me. Go to your own home.

77
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,390
No.

78
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,320
Why are you coming to my place?

79
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,420
Don't. You can't come.

80
00:09:50,420 --> 00:09:51,770
I won't open the door for you.

81
00:09:51,770 --> 00:09:54,450
When have I needed permission
to go to your place?

82
00:09:54,450 --> 00:09:55,900
That's the problem.

83
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:59,430
You should ask for permission
to go to someone else's house.

84
00:09:59,530 --> 00:10:01,500
I don't want to be alone today.

85
00:10:03,860 --> 00:10:04,830
Why?

86
00:10:05,310 --> 00:10:07,310
Why don't you want to be alone today?

87
00:10:20,910 --> 00:10:22,260
I'm home.

88
00:10:25,150 --> 00:10:27,880
What's going on?
It's so late. Where's everyone?

89
00:10:34,850 --> 00:10:36,320
They won't be back tonight.

90
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,430
What?

91
00:10:37,790 --> 00:10:39,320
Your parents went on a trip.

92
00:10:39,620 --> 00:10:41,620
They said they'll be back on Sunday.

93
00:10:41,740 --> 00:10:43,730
Why do you know when I don't?

94
00:10:44,300 --> 00:10:47,810
I know, right? You should
pay more attention to your parents.

95
00:10:48,250 --> 00:10:51,650
Hey, why don't you just
change your name to Yeo Dohyun?

96
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:53,740
No.

97
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,650
I guessed so.

98
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:09,680
Hey.

99
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:11,640
Did you come here

100
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:13,700
knowing my parents wouldn't be back?

101
00:11:14,610 --> 00:11:15,600
Yeah.

102
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:18,520
I figured you'd be scared
spending the night alone.

103
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:20,670
I'm not a 10-year-old kid, okay?

104
00:11:24,620 --> 00:11:27,020
I told you to put it in
after the water boils!

105
00:11:34,450 --> 00:11:36,280
Was it in fifth grade?

106
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:40,070
You came to my house crying
because you were scared to sleep alone.

107
00:11:40,070 --> 00:11:41,370
Don't you remember?

108
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:44,600
I was a kid then.

109
00:11:46,550 --> 00:11:47,500
Hey.

110
00:11:47,670 --> 00:11:49,680
Be it back then or now,

111
00:11:50,550 --> 00:11:53,090
you're still terrible at
cooking instant noodles.

112
00:11:53,090 --> 00:11:54,890
You're disappointing, friend.

113
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,160
Let it cook a little more.

114
00:12:05,620 --> 00:12:08,940
I like it like that. Bring it over.

115
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:23,750
Give it to me.

116
00:12:24,220 --> 00:12:25,680
What are you doing?

117
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:28,770
Hey!

118
00:12:38,180 --> 00:12:38,950
Open up.

119
00:12:39,090 --> 00:12:39,790
No—

120
00:13:05,890 --> 00:13:06,840
Open up.

121
00:13:13,790 --> 00:13:15,520
Gosh, I'm full.

122
00:13:19,050 --> 00:13:20,710
Let's do the dishes tomorrow.

123
00:13:22,260 --> 00:13:23,300
Okay.

124
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:43,240
Hey, why are you taking my underwear?

125
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:44,700
It's mine.

126
00:13:45,190 --> 00:13:47,470
Why was your underwear in my drawer?

127
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:49,140
I'll wash up first.

128
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:53,180
Are you staying the night?

129
00:14:08,350 --> 00:14:10,810
Yeo Eunho, come in.

130
00:14:11,310 --> 00:14:12,370
What?

131
00:14:15,280 --> 00:14:17,150
Come in. I'll help you shower.

132
00:14:17,370 --> 00:14:18,490
Are you crazy?

133
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:20,350
You can't wash your own hair.

134
00:14:20,650 --> 00:14:21,730
Get lost.

135
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:24,000
Then get me a pair of house pants.

136
00:14:24,050 --> 00:14:25,380
Get them yourself.

137
00:14:26,750 --> 00:14:28,090
I'm naked.

138
00:14:28,130 --> 00:14:30,390
Didn't you take your underwear with you?

139
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:32,140
I'm coming out.

140
00:14:32,290 --> 00:14:33,550
Whatever.

141
00:14:35,350 --> 00:14:36,790
I'm really coming out.

142
00:14:40,060 --> 00:14:40,810
Okay, okay.

143
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:42,680
I'll get them for you.

144
00:14:49,190 --> 00:14:50,950
I'm leaving them at the door.

145
00:14:55,420 --> 00:14:56,630
Where?

146
00:15:00,890 --> 00:15:01,720
Here.

147
00:15:06,520 --> 00:15:08,170
Us being like this

148
00:15:08,970 --> 00:15:11,400
reminds me of when you were injured.

149
00:15:13,010 --> 00:15:14,350
Which injury?

150
00:15:15,660 --> 00:15:16,940
In ninth grade.

151
00:15:17,740 --> 00:15:18,760
Oh.

152
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:20,050
When you injured your wrist

153
00:15:20,050 --> 00:15:22,250
while preparing for the championship.

154
00:15:23,130 --> 00:15:25,660
I always washed your hair for you then.

155
00:15:25,970 --> 00:15:27,100
Don't you remember?

156
00:15:29,530 --> 00:15:30,790
I remember, of course.

157
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:33,650
You weren't even 170 cm tall then.

158
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:36,170
To match your height,

159
00:15:36,170 --> 00:15:39,000
I always had to hunch over.
It gave me a sore back.

160
00:15:42,390 --> 00:15:44,940
And now the little munchkin

161
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:46,880
is all grown up.

162
00:15:53,930 --> 00:15:56,640
I'll rinse it for you.
Tilt your head back.

163
00:16:02,330 --> 00:16:03,590
It's too hot!

164
00:16:04,900 --> 00:16:06,190
Bear with it.

165
00:16:07,420 --> 00:16:11,420
Turn the temperature down!
Rinse it properly!

166
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:25,380
Hey, towel.

167
00:16:34,550 --> 00:16:36,080
What are you doing?

168
00:16:38,250 --> 00:16:39,270
I'm cold.

169
00:16:39,460 --> 00:16:42,190
What do you mean you're cold? Get off!

170
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:59,760
You can dry your own hair, right?

171
00:17:00,220 --> 00:17:01,260
Hey!

172
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:04,359
I'll leave you to it.

173
00:17:24,359 --> 00:17:27,109
Oh? Where did the cake come from?

174
00:17:43,510 --> 00:17:44,910
It's 12 AM.

175
00:17:47,100 --> 00:17:48,270
It is.

176
00:17:54,420 --> 00:17:56,480
Don't you have something to say to me?

177
00:17:59,090 --> 00:18:00,320
Do I?

178
00:18:00,900 --> 00:18:01,900
Yeah.

179
00:18:04,230 --> 00:18:06,020
No, I don't, you dummy.

180
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:09,550
Do you really have nothing to say?

181
00:18:10,130 --> 00:18:12,350
I said no. Why do you keep asking?

182
00:18:12,620 --> 00:18:14,620
Is there something you want to hear?

183
00:18:15,230 --> 00:18:16,760
If I say yes, will you say it?

184
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:18,320
No matter what it is?

185
00:18:22,550 --> 00:18:23,750
Yeo Eunho.

186
00:18:29,350 --> 00:18:30,960
Wish me a happy birthday.

187
00:18:31,030 --> 00:18:32,970
Right, it's your birthday!

188
00:18:34,300 --> 00:18:36,490
Sorry, I forgot.

189
00:18:49,180 --> 00:18:50,390
Make a wish.

190
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:57,170
I hope I never fight with Yeo Eunho,

191
00:18:57,370 --> 00:18:58,990
and we stay happy forever.

192
00:18:59,150 --> 00:19:01,740
How can you say your wish out loud, dummy?

193
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:03,780
It won't come true now.

194
00:19:22,600 --> 00:19:24,510
Damn, I almost got you.

195
00:19:53,050 --> 00:19:54,500
That was delicious.

196
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:05,720
This is my gift to you.

197
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:10,070
Good night.

198
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:47,240
Gosh, you scared me.

199
00:21:49,520 --> 00:21:51,450
What's this? What are you doing up?

200
00:21:54,420 --> 00:21:57,170
What are you doing? Get out.

201
00:21:58,220 --> 00:22:00,850
Hey, if you come any closer, I'll hit you.

202
00:22:04,840 --> 00:22:06,250
Stay still.

203
00:22:07,960 --> 00:22:09,510
It's my birthday today.

204
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:13,760
Go away, Cha Dohyun.

205
00:23:28,770 --> 00:23:35,220
[Summertime]

206
00:23:36,500 --> 00:23:37,580
No.

207
00:23:37,900 --> 00:23:40,230
The more you say no,
the more I want to do it,

208
00:23:40,440 --> 00:23:41,670
my darling.

209
00:23:42,590 --> 00:23:44,580
Come out. It's time for school.

210
00:23:44,660 --> 00:23:46,250
Please leave me alone!

211
00:23:46,430 --> 00:23:49,070
Yihyun, were you close to anyone before?

212
00:23:49,770 --> 00:23:51,510
I had a crush on a friend.

213
00:23:52,880 --> 00:23:54,300
How it turned out?

214
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:57,170
I ran away.

215
00:23:58,470 --> 00:23:59,770
To protect him.

216
00:24:00,690 --> 00:24:03,720
You ran away to protect him?

217
00:24:04,380 --> 00:24:06,220
Look into your own heart.

218
00:24:06,610 --> 00:24:07,610
That comes first.

219
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:08,910
I like you.

220
00:24:08,970 --> 00:24:10,380
Screw you, you prick!

221
00:24:10,500 --> 00:24:11,550
-What's wrong?
-What's wrong?

222
00:24:11,550 --> 00:24:12,720
Don't toy with me,

223
00:24:12,870 --> 00:24:13,850
you scumbag.

224
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:17,000
Will it make you feel better
to pretend everything I do

225
00:24:17,150 --> 00:24:19,000
is just a joke?

226
00:24:21,800 --> 00:24:24,690
Since everything's a joke to you,
you shouldn't mind this either, right?
